(card "exp:H-R1-3_ratio_vol_blend" :type "experiment"
  :subj "exp:H-R1-3_ratio_vol_blend"
  :body "---\nnav: 13\ntype: experiment\nid: H-R1-3\nshort_name: ratio_vol_blend\ntitle: \"H-R1-3 — size = clip(0.5*ratio_norm + 0.5*vol_norm, 0.5, 1.5)\"\narc: 260516a\nteam: h\nround: r1\nparent_arc: \"[[arcs/260516a]]\"\nparent_lineage: \"[[lineages/arc_260516a__team_h__sizing]]\"\ntrain_nav: 2.0311\ntrain_trade_count: 140\ntrain_win_rate: 0.8571\ntrain_sharpe: 6.3648\ntrain_max_drawdown: -0.0066\nval_nav_mean: 1.0526\nval_nav_sigma: 0.0632\nval_window_count: 13\ntest_nav: null\ntest_trade_count: null\ntest_sharpe: null\ntest_win_rate: null\ntest_max_drawdown: null\nanchor_train_nav: 2.1882\nanchor_test_nav: 1.2486\nstatus: falsified\noutcome: no_test_run\nchampion: false\noverfit_score: 0\nleak_audit: clean\naxis: [sizing]\npast_only_window_days: 30\nwarmup_required: 10\ncreated: 2026-05-17T02:00:00\nlast_updated: 2026-05-17T05:09:00\ntags: [arc/260516a, team/h, round/r1, axis/sizing, status/falsified, outcome/no_test_run, leak/clean, size/medium]\n---\n\n# H-R1-3 — size = clip(0.5*ratio_norm + 0.5*vol_norm, 0.5, 1.5)\n\n> **TL;DR** —— H-R1 sweep 第三档：blend ratio_norm + vol_norm 各 50% 作 size。**train NAV 2.03 < anchor 2.19**，未进 test。证明\"两个 weak proxy 混合\"在 anchor pool 上不 productive —— blend 不如 ratio/median 单干 (R1-1 NAV 2.39)。\n\n## 假设 (Hypothesis)\n- ratio_norm = ratio / past-30d-median ratio；vol_norm = pre_avg_amount / baseline_max_avg (1.3M)。\n- 假设：两个 proxy 提供独立信息（信号强度 + 流动性）；50/50 blend 应当比 ratio_norm 单 proxy 更稳。\n- 实测：blend 不仅没赢 R1-1，**连 anchor 都没赢** —— vol_norm 拖了后腿。\n\n## 实现 (Implementation)\n- 主脚本：`/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/team_h/scripts/round_1_runner.py`\n- trade selector = anchor G2 (140 笔)\n- 公式：\n  $$ \\text{size}(t) = \\mathrm{clip}\\!\\left(0.5 \\cdot \\frac{r_t}{\\widetilde{r}^{\\;\\text{past-30d}}_{\\,t}} + 0.5 \\cdot \\frac{\\text{pre\\_avg\\_amt}_t}{1{,}300{,}000},\\; 0.5,\\; 1.5\\right) $$\n- mean_size = 0.829, std_size = 0.310（mean 偏低 = vol_norm 的拖累）。\n\n## Past-only window 处理\n- ratio_norm 共用 `rolling_30d_ratio_median` helper, strict past-only, warmup=10。\n- vol_norm 是 pre-trigger 5min 平均，结构上 past-only。\n- `#leak/clean`。\n\n## 结果 (Results)\n| | NAV | Trades | Sharpe | Win | MaxDD |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| Train | 2.0311 | 140 | 6.36 | 85.7% | -0.66% |\n| Val (rolling 13w) | 1.0526 ± 0.063 | - | - | - | - |\n| Test | NOT RUN | - | - | - | - |\n| **Δ train NAV vs anchor** | **-0.157 (LOSE)** | 0 | -1.34 | 0 | +0.36pp |\n\n## 风险 & overfit 嫌疑\n- overfit_score = 0（train 未过 gate 即砍）。\n- 真正问题：vol_norm 自身 mean 0.66 << 1.0 (从 H-R1-2 知)，blend 进来直接把 mean_size 拉到 0.83，等于 17% systemic deleveraging。NAV 损失 ≈ 0.17 ×（anchor 单笔回报）。\n\n## Lineage（双链网）\n- **derived_from**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n- **dominated_by**: [[arc_260516a__team_h__H-R1-1__rolling_30d_median_solo]]\n- **competes_with**: [[arc_260516a__team_h__H-R1-2__pre_avg_amount_sizing]] (同 R1 共同 fail)\n- **builds against**: [[arc_260516a__team_anchor__anchor_g2__baseline]]\n\n## Reports\n- `/Users/han/project/alpha/alpha_second_v1/arcs/all/260516a_agent_team_beat_current_sota/team_h/output/cross_round_leaderboard_nav.csv` (R1-3)\n- [[arc_260516a__reporter_20260517_0547]]\n\n## Notes / 下次迭代\n- **anti-pattern: 把 unverified weak proxy 与 verified strong proxy blend** —— blend coefficient 是另一个需要 sweep 的维度。R1-3 直接 50/50 是过强假设。\n- 下次 multi-proxy sizing：先单独验证每个 proxy 必须 strict beat anchor；只有都过了再 blend，且 blend coefficient 应 sweep [0.0, 0.25, 0.5, 0.75, 1.0]。\n- vol_norm 这条 proxy 本身可能是 productive 的，但需要 per-ticker normalize（见 H-R1-2 notes）—— 当前 H-R1-3 实质上是被 H-R1-2 的同一个 design flaw 拖死。\n"
  :path "experiments/arc_260516a__team_h__H-R1-3__ratio_vol_blend.md"
  :source_mtime "2026-05-17T10:19:07+08:00"
